| hakanensari | 63 | 22.7% | 2014-04-15 | inactive |
| Gonzalo Rodriguez | 51 | 18.4% | 2019-08-02 | inactive |

- **Tanaka:** They hold the most lines and are the only top-three owner who is still active.
- **hakanensari and Rodriguez:** They are large owners but inactive, so I would not ask them. Rodriguez has 23 commits, the most of anyone.
- **Bartesaghi:** They hold 5 lines (1.8%) and last committed on 2026-08-04. They are active but have a small stake.
